{"version":1,"content":"<p>Linux發行版Fedora 45即將正式發佈。根據Fedora項目團隊公佈的最新安排，新版本定於2026年11月3日星期二正式推出。此前，Fedora 45已經連續兩次未能按照原定時間發佈，主要原因是候選版本未能及時完成，以及多個阻礙正式發佈的關鍵漏洞尚未得到解決。不過，經過開發團隊過去一周的集中修復，相關問題已經得到處理，Fedora 45在最新一次發佈評估會議中正式獲得放行決定。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584426.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T07:04:51.663469+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":199,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T06:48:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:00:17.444239+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T07:00:17.444239+00:00","content_hash":"2566c192103813a16de96ea6edbae8447bdb37f8eaf3d19a3f6163711cd7394e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}